  "findings": [
    "Whole AlpacaClient source reconstructs exactly by one stock latest-price expression replacement. The existing options NaN handling, transport/API/auth/error behavior, daily fallback and final NaN omission remain byte-identical. Valid latest trade and zero still take precedence.",
    "Active caller: HomeActivity ImmortalStocksWidget → AlpacaClient.fetchStockQuotes → parseStockQuotes → StockRow. Earlier HTTP-null-to-empty feedback remains separate and unimplemented; no UI/source/settings changes were bundled.",
    "Frozen eight actual-parser JUnit cases reproduce four intended java.lang.AssertionError failures and four controls on the unchanged source, then all eight pass in the final full suite. JSON bodies and literal price/change/percentage assertions are unchanged.",
    "Actual root build terminal is exit 0, including complete JVM, debug/performance/R8/vital gates. Independent read/hash/count of all 476 XML files confirms 4,573 test cases and zero failures/errors/skips.",
    "Both static APK identities decode to com.immortal.launcher.debug 1.176/code170, same certificate as 1.175. All 23 source assets are unique and byte-exact to current source and baseline; asset entry sets are unchanged. Debug asset payloads are unchanged, and the only optimized asset delta is generated baseline.prof with the same pro/version header."
  ],
